🌟 Four Pillars of OOP

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔒 Encapsulation

Wrapping data and methods into one unit (class).

---

🧬 Inheritance

One class acquires properties of another.

---

🔁 Polymorphism

Same method behaves differently.

---

🎭 Abstraction

Showing only essential details.

---

🎯 Advantages of OOP

✔ Code reusability
✔ Better security
✔ Easy maintenance
✔ Real-world modeling

